OL,3,GNEWSANew future for pub after 'violent'
OL,4,Aglass attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village pub where a man suffered
OL,7,Flife-changing injuries in a "violent"
OL,8,Fglass attack could reopen next month
OL,9,Funder new management.
OL,11,FThe King's Head in Cockfield had its
OL,12,Flicence suspended by Durham County
OL,13,FCouncil on 1 August following the
OL,14,F"sustained, violent and entirely
OL,15,Funprovoked" assault.
OL,17,FThe suspension was lifted by the
OL,18,Fcouncil's licensing sub-committee on
OL,19,FMonday, subject to new conditions.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
