OL,3,GNEWSANew future for pub after 'violent'
OL,4,Aglass attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese include the appointment of a new
OL,7,Ftenant, installation of CCTV, a new
OL,8,Fincidents' register and drugs policy,
OL,9,Fand additional staff training.
